{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045150/extras/b6349af3e965951219f7d412f087c409.avif?t=1758594988\" width=184 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u539f\u4f5c\uff1a<i>\u4e0a\u6d77</i>\u30a2\u30ea\u30b9\u5e7b\u6a02\u56e3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u6771\u65b9\u540c\u4eba\u4e8c\u6b21\u521b\u4f5c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cute-style desktop pet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Youmu Konpaku, the gardener of Hakugyokurou, <strong>your job is to feed Lady Yuyuko various files</strong>! In most cases she isn\u2019t picky~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At heart this is a file-shredder wearing the skin of a desktop pet. Of course, the \u201cfood\u201d you feed her will be sent to the Recycle Bin rather than vanishing outright \u2014 except in some cases...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s fine if you don\u2019t feed Yuyuko for a long time, but she\u2019ll feel a little sad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also interactive behaviors, like picking her up and shaking her, or feeding files that contain certain keywords \u2014 go try it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feeding concept by: IWasAllen</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045150?t=1758594988","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045150?t=1758594988","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045150/7fb4ac6d92b9db5d746a389278ddb15d6b03bc92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758594988","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045150/7fb4ac6d92b9db5d746a389278ddb15d6b03bc92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758594988","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045150/extras/b6349af3e965951219f7d412f087c409.avif?t=1758594988\" width=184 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u539f\u4f5c\uff1a<i>\u4e0a\u6d77</i>\u30a2\u30ea\u30b9\u5e7b\u6a02\u56e3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u6771\u65b9\u540c\u4eba\u4e8c\u6b21\u521b\u4f5c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cute-style desktop pet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Youmu Konpaku, the gardener of Hakugyokurou, <strong>your job is to feed Lady Yuyuko various files</strong>! In most cases she isn\u2019t picky~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At heart this is a file-shredder wearing the skin of a desktop pet. Of course, the \u201cfood\u201d you feed her will be sent to the Recycle Bin rather than vanishing outright \u2014 except in some cases...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s fine if you don\u2019t feed Yuyuko for a long time, but she\u2019ll feel a little sad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also interactive behaviors, like picking her up and shaking her, or feeding files that contain certain keywords \u2014 go try it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feeding concept by: IWasAllen</strong></p>","developers":["LancerKoi"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045150/a92931ab49e99969c20746963298c5e2ab2feb91/header.jpg?t=1758594988","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045150/2047415061/808452e79080cb3901727456755335623e9130f8/1758197079/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758594986","dash_h264":"https://v